AedwenOS: Material 3 Expressive partition bars and legend for the Disk step

Calamares paints the partition bars and their legend itself, with a
hard-coded Breeze palette, a 1 px darker border, a gloss gradient, 3 px
corners and legend names in Qt::black (unreadable on a dark theme). This
follows the AedwenOS System Surfaces design ("After install" bar) instead:

  - colours from aedwen-partition-colors.h, generated from the AedwenOS
    palette by scripts/generate-calamares-branding.py (EFI tertiary
    container, system primary, swap secondary container, ...)
  - flat segments with 3 px gaps, 3 px inner corners, rounded outer ends;
    8 % state layer on hover, 2 px on-surface ring when selected
  - legend text in the palette's text colour (name) and 72 % of it (details),
    flat rounded swatches

Against Calamares v3.4.2.

